{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"b0f742352f7a60c2586b64b98827c1c09bdb39463187a3af11673be2f79470e7","ja":"リラックス大作戦","zh":"放松大作战","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"55826bb55d33720ff61227be190089e531f527702d2b42d22e118623d1f166f8","ja":"リラックスと言えば、ミキミキ！\nミキミキといえばお昼寝っしょー！","zh":"说到放松，那就是美希美希！\n说到美希美希，当然就是睡午觉啦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"39a2c86f8c7d9be69bb8dbad7194035fabe625e997f0db518d668c7163e35640","ja":"ってことで、ミキミキ、\nお昼寝のお手本よろよろ～！","zh":"所以说，美希希，\n午睡的示范就拜托啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"92892a40efeafea12050f7b79d7bc4125c43c0231c428059a77feb7818c2a87c","ja":"えー！　ミキ、今、別に眠くないよ。\nお昼寝のフリするだけならいいけど……。","zh":"诶～！美希现在又没有特别困。\n只是装作睡午觉的话倒是可以啦……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2d5890444fd9eaf6190dfa6e6b4aaf5c9f3e63af100fc667efad2f5ec032236b","ja":"事務所のソファーで寝ると\n気持ちいいんだよ。一緒に寝る？　……あふぅ。","zh":"在事务所的沙发上睡觉\n很舒服的哦。要一起睡吗？……啊呜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"2735cc4e0a81dfaef3d6691d7ecc429e9c56d0a6e998318fbda1c708a5a46669","ja":"お昼寝ですか？\nわ、わかりましたっ！","zh":"要午睡吗？\n我、我知道了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8976f5837d7d2131922b747b575c21b264cab7ed0b2de39fcde81f716d6d1b01","ja":"5分後……","zh":"5分钟后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"a514e6f6259bd503734b1058fe14653d8558de42bb38c989b9e8c7cc75aa2b8e","ja":"あれっ！？　もう、お昼寝はいいの？","zh":"哎呀！？已经不睡午觉了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"5e90a27ed8cac39ccac0795acb2fa9829b0df75a9c102704238b8ae62a0184d9","ja":"やっぱり、収録のことが気になっちゃって……。","zh":"我果然还是有点在意收录的事……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"59515748e7c72e131eb1e04e003350ea117dc0c8a7b973528a12ddb489ab508b","ja":"美希さんはすぐ寝ちゃったんだけど、\n私たちはちょっと……。","zh":"美希前辈很快就睡着了，\n但我们却有点……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"3fbbb65f42b5fa3470ddd057b33a926384cdc241f2844f100bbd4d931ba9d55e","ja":"う～ん……。じゃあ、次はお姫ちん！\n何か、リラックスする方法ない？","zh":"唔～……那接下来是贵音亲！\n有什么能放松下来的方法吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"3489a26d2700019c8f9714c65cbd110c09667da515038337989d0c733d4f7597","ja":"そうですね……やはり、余計なことを考えないのが\n大切なのではないかと。","zh":"也是呢……我觉得，最关键的果然还是\n不要胡思乱想吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"1d9325b0d8817645c3f12ad2a170ecf165d1e3ed86560713b5c652db10db1c7b","ja":"もしかして、無の境地みたいな感じですか？\nさすが貴音さんです！","zh":"难道说是类似心如止水的境界吗？\n不愧是贵音！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"609b8081b7394fd387749e9c50edc1508229e306a75bee6ca0a6212db020ae02","ja":"はい。確かに無とも言えるのやもしれません。\nひとつのことに意識を集中させる……。","zh":"是的。或许确实可以说是“无”呢。\n将意识集中在同一件事情上……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"e583f4b559afd99261ed9b2e663028a5c18670809c0613d8849a8dde77e0e834","ja":"すなわち、おやつたいむで、\nゆったりとした時間を過ごすのです！","zh":"也就是说，要在点心时间，\n度过一段悠闲的时光！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"7d7b92140d3a5ecefffc6855e367b65423d19039a197b2b61c974a9e2efc4446","ja":"わ～い♪　たしかに、甘いものを食べたら、\n緊張もどっか行っちゃいそうですね♪","zh":"太棒了～♪ 确实，要是吃了甜食的话，\n感觉紧张也会跑到九霄云外去呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"7471b179790be12d9b29f7604a4e35d835de8502ee03e62413f47302b71406c7","ja":"なるほど、お菓子……。","zh":"原来如此，点心……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1279.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"ae55172fabba3d8be290bea68861377106cba74c8869f975247b4ff7c681f420","ja":"って、ええっ！？\nなんだか思っていたのとは違うような気が……？","zh":"等等，诶诶！？\n总觉得好像和我想象的不太一样……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
